#lang "emoji"

🔧 parseInput🟠📝 input🔵 📝 🟦🟪 🟩
   🔙 split🟠input🛑 " "🔵🚩
🟥

🔧 str🟠📝 s🔵 📝 🟩
    🔙 s ➕ ""🚩
🟥

🔧 atoi🟠📝 s🔵 🔢 🟩
    🌊 🔢 n ✍️ 0🚩

    ❓ 🟠🟠"" ➕ s🟦0🟪🔵 🤝 "-"🔵 🟩
        🔁 🟠i 📥 1🛑 len🟠s🔵🔵 🟩
            n ✍️ n ✖️ 10 ➕ ord🟠"" ➕ s🟦i🟪🔵 ➖ ord🟠"0"🔵🚩
        🟥
        🔙 ➖n🚩
    🟥

    🔁 🟠i 📥 len🟠s🔵🔵 🟩
        n ✍️ n ✖️ 10 ➕ ord🟠"" ➕ s🟦i🟪🔵 ➖ ord🟠"0"🔵🚩
    🟥

    🔙 n🚩
🟥

🔧 isNumber🟠📝 s🔵 🔢🟩
    🔁 🟠i 📥 len🟠s🔵🔵 🟩
        ❓ 🟠ord🟠str🟠s🟦i🟪🔵🔵 ⬇️ ord🟠"0"🔵 📌 ord🟠str🟠s🟦i🟪🔵🔵 ⬆️ ord🟠"9"🔵🔵 🟩
            🔙 0🚩
        🟥
    🟥
    🔙 1🚩
🟥
🔧 shouldPop🟠📝 token🛑 📝 top🔵 🔢 🟩
    🔙 🟠🟠token 🤝 "*" 📌 token 🤝 "/"🔵 🤝🤝 🟠top 🤝 "*" 📌 top 🤝 "/"🔵🔵 📌
           🟠🟠token 🤝 "+" 📌 token 🤝 "-"🔵 🤝🤝 🟠top 🤝 "+" 📌 top 🤝 "-" 📌 top 🤝 "*" 📌 top 🤝 "/"🔵🔵🚩
🟥

🔧 calc🟠🔢 a🛑 🔢 b🛑 📝 op🔵 🔢 🟩
    ❓ 🟠op 🤝 "+"🔵 🟩
        🔙 a ➕ b🚩
    🟥 🚪 ❓ 🟠op 🤝 "-"🔵 🟩
        🔙 a ➖ b🚩
    🟥 🚪 ❓ 🟠op 🤝 "*"🔵 🟩
        🔙 a ✖️ b🚩
    🟥 🚪 ❓ 🟠op 🤝 "/"🔵 🟩
        🔙 a ➗ b🚩
    🟥
🟥

🔧 shuntingYard🟠📝🟦🟪 tokens🔵 📝 🟩
   🌊 📝🟦1🟪 output🚩
   output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
   🌊 📝🟦1🟪 stack🚩
   stack ✍️ pop🟠stack🔵🚩
   🔁🟠i 📥 len🟠tokens🔵🔵 🟩
        🌊 📝 token ✍️ tokens🟦i🟪🚩
        ❓🟠isNumber🟠token🔵🔵 🟩
            output ✍️ append🟠output🛑 token🔵🚩
        🟥 🚪 ❓🟠token 🤝 "("🔵 🟩
            stack ✍️ append🟠stack🛑 token🔵🚩
        🟥 🚪 ❓🟠token 🤝 ")"🔵 🟩
            🔄🟠len🟠stack🔵 ⬆️ 0 🤝🤝 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪 ❌ "("🔵 🟩
                🌊 🔢 result ✍️ calc🟠atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 2🟪🔵🛑 atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🛑 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🚩
                output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
                output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
                output ✍️ append🟠output🛑 result ➕ ""🔵🚩
                stack ✍️ pop🟠stack🔵🚩
            🟥
            stack ✍️ pop🟠stack🔵🚩
        🟥 🚪 🟩
            🔄🟠len🟠stack🔵 ⬆️ 0 🤝🤝 shouldPop🟠token🛑 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵 🤝🤝 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪 ❌ "("🔵 🟩
                🌊 🔢 result ✍️ calc🟠atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 2🟪🔵🛑 atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🛑 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🚩
                output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
                output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
                output ✍️ append🟠output🛑 result ➕ ""🔵🚩
                stack ✍️ pop🟠stack🔵🚩
            🟥
            stack ✍️ append🟠stack🛑 token🔵🚩
        🟥
   🟥
    🔄🟠len🟠stack🔵 ⬆️ 0🔵 🟩
        🌊 🔢 result ✍️ calc🟠atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 2🟪🔵🛑 atoi🟠output🟦len🟠output🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🛑 stack🟦len🟠stack🔵 ➖ 1🟪🔵🚩
        output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
        output ✍️ pop🟠output🔵🚩
        output ✍️ append🟠output🛑 result ➕ ""🔵🚩
        stack ✍️ pop🟠stack🔵🚩
    🟥
    🔙 output🟦0🟪🔚🚩
🟥
🔄🟠1🔵🟩
    🌊 📝 input ✍️ input🟠"Enter a calculation: \n"🔵🚩
    🌊 📝🟦🟪 tokens ✍️ parseInput🟠input🔵🚩
    🌊 📝 output ✍️ shuntingYard🟠tokens🔵🚩
    print🟠output ➕ "\n"🔵🚩
🟥
